OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stole ambulance with
OL,4,Apatient inside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stole an ambulance with a
OL,7,Fpatient and paramedic inside has been
OL,8,Fjailed for 21 months.
OL,10,FMarshall Leese was chased by police for
OL,11,Ftwo miles after taking the ambulance
OL,12,Ffrom outside the Royal Stoke University
OL,13,FHospital in Stoke-on-Trent.
OL,15,FHe stopped at a petrol station on the
OL,16,FA34 in Newcastle-under-Lyme and fled
OL,17,Fthe vehicle but was found hiding nearby
OL,18,Fby a police sniffer dog.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
